# 1.5.1: the reel's SOURCE Play 1 (par189 6): on the reel's pages the keys play voice 1 (out on its channel), and a
# new splice records it; Play All (9): the three voices together
wait 3500
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect view 6
spin K1 6
expect par189 6
out
tapkey 5
wait 100
expect_out USB 90 3A 64
tap EDIT
key 7 down
wait 1500
key 7 up
tap REC
wait 200
expect reelspl 1
spin K1 3
expect par189 9
tapkey 9
wait 100
expect_out USB 91 3E 64
